 40pcs.\n      钻石 - 20pcs.\n\n今年钻石产量很低——加价50%？伊格兰斯袭击了我们上一支安格利文商队——增派守卫？——D·\n钻石同意加价。武装商队里的商人，不增派守卫。利润已经够薄了！——S·。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4cb39409294c367bbf660b9aff2a6691dca07bf20b316e2c446ed347756e96fe","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8a2c527b83799d3b5ed56b8670ae6486a06e3a6b54b3f54f5461cf961b81c1bf","logical_entry_identity":"a4be2ab86932f2255d3a45e5e288300729269eb3474bef4dce2932b7f9ab0b9a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Pinned Down","source_tag":"_t","target":"压制"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0e00f4521075b2a911a39d09346c69d01666c5fc8fc0608747b200f6dfd1c134","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8a2ea090d7c7c8949f8f94e4e48fe82cd53275149178408036ce8ebc16bff127","logical_entry_identity":"6f5d3a79ec2f443f15681f7e9b4a047d383ecbaf692a94259264bbaedce38048","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"heal yourself and all friendly characters within 10 spaces for %d","source_tag":"tformat","target":"治疗你自己和周围10格内的所有友方生物%d点生命值"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"79b4d7ee33103e3b3d2f25e8d489aaa0866658973a3432b7db91394b9d7fd117","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8a2eeba0dc5f1d63d8c0241b766c0ac077ca2ca28e8e22b2fa8e16dff9b5adff","logical_entry_identity":"35d62df8e346fb332f7b708f10b1810f2bf9ba552b14ba310f1b43e1c67938fd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"     Play!     ","source_tag":"_t","target":"     游玩！     "},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aad264ae8d7d47f777d12dd15288641b03c4aba68dcdeb76c6930200aee57d38","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8a2f1b6b326dfbbefafd221d4c5c052f037fc3e7b98a289e11a8a3a0ef1436b8","logical_entry_identity":"aa31af8865c1b51a517260ebb01382f1d1ba4850cb5f1aed6da135ff913cf43e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Killed Linaniil, the Supreme Archmage of Angolwen.","source_tag":"_t","target":"杀死安格利文的超阶魔导师莱娜尼尔。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d7cf3ae69b303b6253f0051b8eb6edaba773344876ec987e90b68a3e9e5d22fc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8a32055d01f